    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Ravager",
    "summary": "During [your Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), as this model is **selected to shoot**, you can Empower it by paying a [Pain token](vsdata:ability/drukhari.power-from-pain). While it remains Empowered, after it shoots, pick an enemy unit that any of those attacks hit. That unit is suppressed until your next turn begins. Attacks by models of a suppressed unit get -1 to [Hit](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls).",
